Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Load and draw the desktop wallpaper directly in CDefView because Wine
 PaintDesktop() does not work across processes, draw it in OnEraseBackground()
 with support for tile, center and stretch modes, read the desktop colour
 directly from the registry to avoid Wine stale per-process colour cache, and
 broadcast WM_SYSCOLORCHANGE after applying a desktop background color so the
 running ReactOS Explorer session repaints without logout.
Last-Modified: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 19:30:09 +0300

--- a/reactos-src/dll/cpl/desk/background.c
+++ b/reactos-src/dll/cpl/desk/background.c
@@ -1144,6 +1144,7 @@ SetDesktopBackColor(HWND hwndDlg, PBACKG
                   (wcslen(clText) + 1) * sizeof(TCHAR));
 
     RegCloseKey(hKey);
+    SendMessage(HWND_BROADCAST, WM_SYSCOLORCHANGE, 0, 0);
 }
 
